# Shared .dockerignore for both web/Dockerfile and cms/Dockerfile
# (build context is `landing/`). Each Dockerfile selectively COPYs
# the workspace folders it needs.

# Workspace deps — re-installed in the builder stage.
**/node_modules/

# Build artefacts.
**/dist/
**/.astro/
**/.next/

# Local design-bundle export (1.3 MB, gitignored anyway).
.design-bundle/

# Docs + design source — not used at runtime.
docs/

# Secrets, never bake into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Logs + editor noise.
*.log
.DS_Store

# Don't ship test sources into the runtime layer.
**/*.smoke.test.ts
**/*.test.ts
